# Daily driver: use where misreading a document is expensive.
#
# The context here is the whole point of this file. Ollama's API default is
# num_ctx=4096 on both /api/generate and /api/chat -- NOT the model card's
# 256K -- so any client that doesn't set it explicitly silently truncates.
# Baking it into a tag fixes it for every client at once.
#
# 16384 is the measured ceiling: see plans/local-ai-stack.md section 6. Larger
# contexts push the KV cache out of the 4 GiB of VRAM and generation collapses.
#
# Build:  ollama create cortex-4b -f cortex-4b.Modelfile
# Verify: ollama show cortex-4b --parameters

FROM qwen3-vl:4b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
